  "scope": "# 576426a573af \u2014 v2.2.0 \u2014 review-c91c8b8b50062268\n\n- Defect: fixed setting-order public episode names disclosed private axis/precedence settings.\n- Repair: exact visible-content identifiers, public-field projection, sorted batch writes, and six behavior regressions.\n- Final canonical generator SHA-256: `d49ae2e612265752d5ce3cec5982071c6c6d96bb35183a47dff37719fd2eb0be` (unchanged).\n- Validation: before/strict-after batteries 12/12 each; focused tests 36/36; portable task tests 272/272; fresh exact-patch tests 272/272.\n- Lessons: 4 ordered demos + next query; 300/300 production lessons and 1,500/1,500 leave-one-out rotations pass three named rivals; 1,491 unique inputs.\n- Schedule: all 8 declared starts, seed 0, three bands; 24/24 lessons and 120/120 rotations pass (32 unique inputs).\n- Canonical four-query export: 4 demos + 4 distinct queries, 8 distinct inputs/Racket labels, 4/4 queries identified from demos.\n- Proposed prototype: 4 settings \u00d7 (2 demos + 4 distinct queries), 16/16 identified queries; protected Racket programs and exact hashes retained.\n- Authority unchanged: canonical Racket `892d64eecd2e`; all 7 transported file hashes match fresh replay; remaining repair blocker: none.\n- Acceptance: routine for the bounded exporter correction. Variants remain proposed/unapproved; private solve-query correctness remains unknown.\n\n## Scope and recommendation",
